{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53196","headline":"诗偈 二十一 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见好畜生，知是喽罗汉。\n枉法取人钱，夸道能计算。\n得即浑家用，受苦没人伴。\n有力任他骑，棒鞭脊上楦。\n觜上着{金革}头，口中衔铁片。\n项领被磨穿，鼻孔芒绳绊。\n自种还自收，佛也不能断。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}